id: top-app-bar
name: Top app bar (small 64dp, medium 112dp)
category: navigation
summary: The page header. Small is a single 64dp row, medium is 112dp with the title on a second line. Tonal on scroll.
requires: foundation, icon-button
@@spec
- Small: 64dp tall, leading icon button, title Title Large, trailing actions (up to 3 icon buttons).
- Medium: 112dp tall, actions on the top row, title Headline Small on the bottom row.
- Resting container is the page surface. When content scrolls under it, it switches to surface-2 (set data-scrolled).
- Horizontal padding 4dp around icon buttons (they are 48dp targets inside 16dp insets).
- The page's single h1 lives in the app bar title, or directly below it, never both.
@@a11y
- Wrap in <header>. The title is the page <h1> (or aria-level is set if it is not).
- Every action is an icon button with aria-label.
- Navigation landmarks are named (aria-label) when there is more than one on the page.
@@html
<header class="md-top-app-bar">
  <button class="md-icon-btn" type="button" aria-label="Open navigation menu" aria-haspopup="dialog">
    <span class="md-icon" aria-hidden="true">menu</span>
  </button>
  <h1 class="md-top-app-bar__title">Markets</h1>
  <div class="md-top-app-bar__actions">
    <button class="md-icon-btn" type="button" aria-label="Search">
      <span class="md-icon" aria-hidden="true">search</span>
    </button>
    <button class="md-icon-btn" type="button" aria-label="Toggle dark mode" aria-pressed="false" data-md-theme-toggle>
      <span class="md-icon" aria-hidden="true">dark_mode</span>
    </button>
  </div>
</header>

<!-- medium variant: add the modifier -->
<header class="md-top-app-bar md-top-app-bar--medium">
  <button class="md-icon-btn" type="button" aria-label="Back">
    <span class="md-icon" aria-hidden="true">arrow_back</span>
  </button>
  <div class="md-top-app-bar__actions"></div>
  <h1 class="md-top-app-bar__title">A longer page title</h1>
</header>
@@css
.md-top-app-bar {
  position: sticky;
  top: 0;
  z-index: 10;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: var(--sp-xs);
  min-height: 4rem;
  padding: 0 var(--sp-xs);
  background: var(--md-surface);
  color: var(--md-on-surface);
  transition: background-color var(--md-spring-default-effects-dur) var(--md-spring-default-effects);
}

.md-top-app-bar[data-scrolled] { background: var(--md-surface-2); }

.md-top-app-bar__title {
  flex: 1;
  min-width: 0;
  margin: 0;
  overflow: hidden;
  font-family: var(--md-font-brand);
  font-size: var(--md-type-title-large-size);
  font-weight: var(--md-type-title-large-weight);
  line-height: var(--md-type-title-large-line);
  letter-spacing: var(--md-type-title-large-tracking);
  text-overflow: ellipsis;
  white-space: nowrap;
}

.md-top-app-bar__actions {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
}

.md-top-app-bar--medium {
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  align-content: space-between;
  min-height: 7rem;
  padding-bottom: var(--sp-lg);
}
.md-top-app-bar--medium .md-top-app-bar__actions { margin-inline-start: auto; }
.md-top-app-bar--medium .md-top-app-bar__title {
  flex: 0 0 100%;
  padding: 0 var(--sp-md);
  font-size: var(--md-type-headline-small-size);
  line-height: var(--md-type-headline-small-line);
  letter-spacing: var(--md-type-headline-small-tracking);
  white-space: normal;
}
@@js
// Tonal bar once the page scrolls under it.
(function () {
  var bar = document.querySelector('.md-top-app-bar');
  if (!bar) return;
  var update = function () {
    if (window.scrollY > 0) bar.setAttribute('data-scrolled', '');
    else bar.removeAttribute('data-scrolled');
  };
  addEventListener('scroll', update, { passive: true });
  update();
})();
@@notes
Icon names used here (menu, search, dark_mode, arrow_back) are common, but verify each in a static Material Symbols subset.
